### Get all seeded orders
GET http://localhost:3000/api/orders

### Get one order
GET http://localhost:3000/api/orders/1

### Missing order (404)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/orders/9999

### Create a valid order
POST http://localhost:3000/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": "Beza",
  "area": "Bole",
  "totalSantim": 45000,
  "phone": "0912345678"
}

### Invalid total (400)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": "Beza",
  "area": "Bole",
  "totalSantim": -5
}

### Unknown field is stripped by whitelist
POST http://localhost:3000/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": "Beza",
  "area": "Bole",
  "totalSantim": 45000,
  "isAdmin": true
}
